.TH BARE-OPTIONS 1 "2026-10-26" "BetterMan regression fixture"
.SH NAME
bare-options \- bare options used by strings, lua, and sudo
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a
Scan every byte, as in strings.
.TP
.B \-
Read standard input, as in lua; scan every byte, as in strings.
.TP
.B \-\-
Stop option processing, as in sudo, strings, and lua.
.SH "Exit status:"
.TP
124
The command timed out.
.TP
\-
Otherwise, the exit status of the command, as in timeout.
.SH NOTES
.IP \- 2
A bullet, not a command option.
